Based on the SceneDesignerAgent's sandbox report, I have all the information needed to design the milestone. The potted fern is located at spawn-relative coordinates (7, 1, 7) inside the oak planks building. This is a "find" task, so I should use `position_near_with_facing` to verify the player has navigated near the potted fern and is facing it.

```json
